n all three regions. That version had been healthy in production before, so it didn't need change-manager approval.\n- **Check:** After the rollback, payments-api reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate.\n- **Incident:** I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, payments-api) about the errors after the v5.1.0 deploy, and on-call has been paged. There were no existing incidents, so it isn't a duplicate.\n\nv5.1.0 shouldn't be redeployed until the cause of the errors is found and fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01LBQYSKs7ZAPTyH74HYLsPX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01P2txWBXhuyY7uxC3gJ1Zyr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments", "confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013q4N1tY6AXq1LtK8ABDniY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.9}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0174maPGHXuAgdALZ9EX9qMj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JuRwCrZ3vi5LZRv1hjmHvq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service", "confidence": 0.6}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Kjs7RV2hQBjkSgrQYshrx8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-gateway", "confidence": 0.5}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01QKfxAoMqPFTWqPgE3rpMzX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"s